          <h3 class="brief__code">INCEPTION-V3</h3>
          <p class="brief__title">Trash Classification with InceptionV3</p>
          <p class="brief__sub">Mar 2024 – Jun 2024</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      
      <h4 class="brief__label">Objective</h4>
      <p>Trained and benchmarked deep transfer learning architectures to automate municipal waste categorization into 6 recyclable streams.</p>
      <h4 class="brief__label">Results</h4><ul class="brief__results"><li>Fine-tuned InceptionV3 convolutional layers with custom data augmentation to prevent overfitting.</li><li>Achieved rapid convergence and deployed an interactive evaluation dashboard with Streamlit.</li></ul>
