      <h4 class="brief__label">Objective</h4>
      <p>Engineered a cross-platform mobile application linking local food businesses with nearby consumers to reduce retail food waste.</p>
      <h4 class="brief__label">Results</h4><ul class="brief__results"><li>Built real-time product discovery, location-based listings, and push notifications with Google Maps API.</li><li>Integrated Firebase Auth and Cloud Firestore for atomic transaction handling and zero-downtime updates.</li></ul>
