      <h4 class="brief__label">Objective</h4>
      <p>Designed and built an internet-connected tracked rover featuring dual motor control, low-latency FPV video streaming, and a multi-axis servo manipulator arm.</p>
      <h4 class="brief__label">Results</h4><ul class="brief__results"><li>Programmed ESP32 dual-core FreeRTOS firmware handling concurrent PWM motor drive and WebSocket packet ingestion.</li><li>Crafted a responsive browser-based joystick teleoperation UI streaming live camera telemetry under 120ms latency.</li></ul>
