    <article class="brief" data-brief="p-spam-classifier" hidden="" aria-label="Briefing: SMS & WhatsApp Spam Detection with Indonesian Slang Normalization">
      <header class="brief__head">
        <div class="brief__id">
          <p class="brief__kicker">
            <span class="brief__kind brief__kind--project">Launch</span>
            <span class="brief__status brief__status--complete">COMPLETE</span>
            <span class="brief__kind brief__kind--research">🔬 Research</span>
          </p>
          <h3 class="brief__code">SPAM CLASSIFIER</h3>
          <p class="brief__title">SMS & WhatsApp Spam Detection with Indonesian Slang Normalization</p>
          <p class="brief__sub">Jan 2025 – Aug 2025</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      
      <h4 class="brief__label">Objective</h4>
      <p>Undergraduate Thesis: Combating fraudulent SMS and WhatsApp spam in Indonesian colloquial text using specialized lexical normalization and probabilistic classifiers.</p>
      <h4 class="brief__label">Results</h4><ul class="brief__results"><li>Curated and labeled a dataset of 4,000+ Indonesian spam, promotion, and normal text messages.</li><li>Engineered a lexicon-based slang expansion algorithm mapping Indonesian slang/typos to formal standard words.</li><li>Achieved 99.56% classification accuracy using Multinomial Naive Bayes with TF-IDF n-gram vectorization.</li><li>Packaged the inference engine into a production-ready FastAPI microservice with an interactive Streamlit UI.</li></ul>
