          <h3 class="brief__code">FOODLINK</h3>
          <p class="brief__title">FoodLink: Food Redistribution Platform</p>
          <p class="brief__sub">Aug 2025 – Dec 2025</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      
      <h4 class="brief__label">Objective</h4>
      <p>A geospatial, multi-tier web platform orchestrating surplus food donations between commercial donors, volunteers, and beneficiary shelters.</p>
      <h4 class="brief__label">Results</h4><ul class="brief__results"><li>Architected on Laravel 11 with PostgreSQL and PostGIS spatial indexing for high-precision geospatial radius queries.</li><li>Integrated interactive Leaflet.js maps, dynamic Alpine.js UI components, and Tailwind CSS design tokens.</li><li>Implemented strict role-based access control (RBAC) ensuring verified food safety audits and pickup logs.</li></ul>
