    <article class="brief" data-brief="p-aeroscan"  aria-label="Briefing: AeroScan: Military Aircraft Classification & Tactical Dashboard">
      <header class="brief__head">
        <div class="brief__id">
          <p class="brief__kicker">
            <span class="brief__kind brief__kind--project">Launch</span>
            <span class="brief__status brief__status--active">ACTIVE</span>
            <span class="brief__kind brief__kind--research">🔬 Research</span>
          </p>
          <h3 class="brief__code">AEROSCAN</h3>
          <p class="brief__title">AeroScan: Military Aircraft Classification & Tactical Dashboard</p>
          <p class="brief__sub">Jan 2026 – Present</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      
      <h4 class="brief__label">Objective</h4>
      <p>Real-time aerial surveillance platform delivering sub-5ms military aircraft detection, multi-model ensemble classification, and interactive telemetry dashboards.</p>
      <h4 class="brief__label">Results</h4><ul class="brief__results"><li>Engineered a custom YOLOv11x object detector fine-tuned on multi-spectral aerial datasets, achieving 99.4% mAP50-95.</li><li>Optimized deployment with NVIDIA TensorRT FP16 quantization, clocking 3.2ms edge inference on Jetson Orin Nano.</li><li>Constructed an async FastAPI inference microservice streaming bounding boxes and radar coordinates via WebSockets.</li><li>Developed an interactive tactical mission control dashboard in Next.js 15, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.</li></ul>
